{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261023/photo/bkn-20261023215304342-1023_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261023220328\"/><p>玻璃門鬆脫塌下。</p><p>今日(23日)傍晚6時許，一名39歲婦人推開屯門蝴蝶商場一玻璃門時，該道門突然鬆脫塌下，砸傷其頭部，她其後清醒由救護車送往屯門醫院治理。事後，商場內的保安員圍封相關位置，涉事玻璃門則擱在地面。執法部門將案件列作「有人意外受傷」跟進，正調查意外原因。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T15:40:32.306783+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T13:53:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T15:47:32.842452+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T15:34:01.596131+00:00","content_hash":"1693572279f589368db433343b50fb5ec85f22487440541f0f0661ccd6cac3e1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T15:40:32.306783+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}